sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor UI
participant L as LiveRuntime
participant S as AccountStore
participant P as prepare_set() / window_bounds()
participant R as replay(WindowStore, streams)
participant I as read_window() / InfluxDB
participant H as LiveHistory
UI->>L: start(store, set_id)
L->>S: snapshot()
L->>P: validate set, bindings, fingerprint, bounds
P-->>L: plan and account-owned session
loop scheduler every second
    L->>S: snapshot() for running accounts
    L->>P: compare fingerprint on revision change
    alt set configuration changed
        L->>L: running = false, require new session
    else due and free worker, no overlap for same set
        L->>P: window_bounds(item, now)
        L->>R: submit _execute(session, bounds)
        R->>I: read_window(source, start_ns, end_ns, metrics)
        I-->>R: numeric original samples
        Note over R,I: Enforce half-open bounds [start, end)
        Note over R: Reuse session state, feed each timestamp once, preserve delayed pair scores
        R-->>L: result, WindowStore.save_results() returns false
        L->>H: append(result, bounds), enforce retention
    end
end
UI->>L: stop(store, session_id)
Note over L,H: Stop pauses scheduling, retained history stays within configured budgets
